### block proxy-b -> manager front (8443) on m3: DOCKER-USER (forwarded) and INPUT (to the VM's own address)

```
$ vm_root dbcm-lab-m3 
		iptables -I DOCKER-USER -p tcp --dport 8443 -j DROP -m comment --comment e9-partition
		iptables -I INPUT -i docker_gwbridge -p tcp --dport 8443 -j DROP -m comment --comment e9-partition
		iptables -S DOCKER-USER | grep e9-partition; iptables -S INPUT | grep e9-partition
-A DOCKER-USER -p tcp -m tcp --dport 8443 -m comment --comment e9-partition -j DROP
-A INPUT -i docker_gwbridge -p tcp -m tcp --dport 8443 -m comment --comment e9-partition -j DROP
(exit 0)
```

