### heal the partition on m3

```
$ vm_root dbcm-lab-m3 iptables -D DOCKER-USER -p tcp --dport 8443 -j DROP -m comment --comment e9-partition; iptables -D INPUT -i docker_gwbridge -p tcp --dport 8443 -j DROP -m comment --comment e9-partition; iptables -S | grep -c e9-partition || true
0
(exit 0)
```

